"""Passes 1606--1610: five exact continuations of the integral frame cokernel.

1606  Full F2 module filtration of the 30-dimensional Bockstein torsion.
1607  Solver-neutral exact-8 / XOR export and independent-rank certificate.
1608  Chiral four-packing orbit and torsion-signature classification.
1609  Saturated unsigned-to-oriented free-15 lattice bridge.
1610  Two-fiber frame/octet coherent configuration and H-cyclic closure.

All statements are finite exact computations.  The script does not decide the
open global nine-cover resolution problem.
"""
